Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: php-multilang
Architecture: all
Depends: php (>= 8.0), php-pdo, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Reusable multi-language string storage library (PHP source)
 Provides retrieveData, insertData, and dbConnector for storing and
 retrieving translated strings, keyed by string_id + BCP 47 language_id,
 against SQLite, PostgreSQL, or MySQL/MariaDB.
 .
 Ships as source under /usr/share/php/Multilang/ (PSR-4 autoloadable),
 wrapping this project's Composer package -- not a full Packagist mirror.
 The specific PDO driver needed (php-sqlite3, php-pgsql, php-mysql or
 equivalent) is a Suggests, not a Depends: package names for these vary
 across distros and PHP versions, so install whichever backend you need
 through your distro's own PHP extension packages.
Suggests: php-sqlite3, php-pgsql, php-mysql
